<title>USA: IPO PRICING - Peapod Inc prices at $16.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING - Peapod Inc prices at $16.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name			   Peapod Inc</p>
<p>   Priced At					 $16</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range	     $15 - $16</p>
<p>   Number of Shares			4,000,000</p>
<p>   Lead Underwriter		   Smith Barney</p>
<p>NOTE: The proposed number of shares and estimated price range for the planned initial public offering in Peapod were raised to 4.0 million shares from 3.6 million and to $15-$16 from $13-$15.</p>
